sequenceDiagram
  participant Pi
  participant Adapter
  participant Runtime
  participant CAS
  participant DB
  Pi->>Adapter: tool_result(event)
  Adapter->>Runtime: ingestToolResult(normalized)
  Runtime->>CAS: put(raw bytes)
  CAS-->>Runtime: blobId/hash
  Runtime->>DB: prepare saga + evidence
  Runtime-->>Adapter: compact visible result
  Adapter-->>Pi: ToolResultEventResult
  Pi->>Adapter: message_end(host entry)
  Adapter->>Runtime: acknowledge host commit
